OL,3,AInvestigation after female staff at
OL,4,AEiffel Tower replaced by men for
OL,5,Areligious visit
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn investigation has been launched in
OL,8,FFrance after female staff at the Eiffel
OL,9,FTower were replaced by male colleagues
OL,10,Ffor the visit of a Hindu religious
OL,11,Fgroup.
OL,13,FA delegation of around 100 people
OL,14,Flinked to the Bochasanwasi Akshar
OL,15,FPurushottam Swaminarayan Sanstha (BAPS)
OL,16,Fgroup visited the iconic landmark in
OL,17,FParis on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
